{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7437bb59b176badba8ecdbe8d6b882ae4fa68471886cd9c2c66227df2c20b3e7", "ja": "プール土産は水風船♪", "zh": "泳池特产是水气球♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0883398c59817248a23bba5678facc6aeb73bedadf29a99484cc733fcd35625b", "ja": "『水上玉入れ合戦』で使った水風船を、\n観客にプレゼントできないかと思いついた\n可奈。昴と海美も賛成し、それぞれのサイン\nを書いた水風船を、イベント終了後に客席へ\nみんなで投げ入れることにする。", "zh": "可奈想到，能不能把『水上投球大战』中使用的水气球送给观众。\n昴和海美也表示赞成，大家决定在活动结束后，将写有各自签名的水气球投向观众席。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ff7ef9bcf88cb4c80217fe9bc9f35511a1a336346b4aade6169d353ec6b9db0", "ja": "{$P$}さん。さっきの水上玉入れ合戦\nゲームで使った水風船って、もう捨てちゃいますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。刚才在水上投球比赛\n游戏里用的水气球，已经要扔掉了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a5943defa38c8e71a9e12bf391f5f1d3725c3943c96dd86616e2664a88103f39", "ja": "ん？　ああ、もう今日は使わないよ。\n欲しいなら、もらえるんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯？啊，今天已经用不上了。\n你想要的话，应该可以拿走吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "aaef3d636c2c750162df258a1791813aabb9ec50f38012df266c85da2680484e", "ja": "えっと、私じゃなくて、\nお客さんが欲しいって言ってたんです！", "zh": "那个，我不是想要，是客人说想要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "0aecedb99c2f042e5154f90f3e2f112ea23bc12ec72c8ad1e7bc07ce586159c3", "ja": "だからもう捨てるだけなら、\n少しくらいあげちゃってもいいのかなーって。", "zh": "所以啊，要是只是要扔掉的话，送出去一点应该也没关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0fcbd97a5081e3806d308eee6a08d10f519757463d2f2b84ddc9e5fe7eade0de", "ja": "なるほど……。うん、それはいいな。\nイベントの最後に、みんなで客席に投げるとか！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，那倒是不错。\n比如在活动最后，大家一起把它们扔向观众席！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "660464b371795aeeea1df96dcc0782f4aff1b9c946c08d9be3c66d9817f4eff9", "ja": "なになに？　何を投げるって？　ボール？", "zh": "什么什么？要扔什么？球吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c9cb7a5331a08a7d824a4f5c62560670a20c98a800677f8f9a66e7a8bcdbcd3", "ja": "あ、水風船です！　さっきの玉入れで使ったやつ、\nお客さんのお土産にできたらなと思って～。", "zh": "啊，是水气球！就是刚才投球游戏用的那个，\n我想要是能拿来当作送给客人的纪念品就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "7a003e58ddfcd16b10579e15ca5e0aad0e78926479b7792ce9565b162a00c797", "ja": "わぁ、素敵素敵！　水風船がお土産なんて、\nまさに夏のお祭りって感じだよね☆", "zh": "哇，好棒好棒！把水球当作纪念品，真是有种夏日祭典的感觉呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "7c0ab0692acf20acb4bb9c1d6fe30259fd45bd1d06556006c198423113bfc3a5", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　それにサイン入れて客席に投げ入れたら\nプロの野球選手みたいでサイコ―だよな！？", "zh": "啊，对了！要是在上面签上名，再像职业棒球选手那样扔进观众席，感觉超棒的，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "089fe096033aac5aa43081c8c55339ccfd44db0f4b692de0a66cc9a621cd83d7", "ja": "なるほど、それもいいアイディアだ。よし、やろう！\n後で控え席に水風船とサインペンを置いておくよ。", "zh": "原来如此，这也是个好主意。好，就这么办！\n我之后会把水气球和记号笔放到候场席。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6b279da5aa8a9841d1df3ae07043e56a82e97773a7fa0f063416b2fc4613d66b", "ja": "みんなにも伝えておくから、3人も手が空いた時に\nサイン、書いておいてくれるか？", "zh": "我也会告诉大家，所以你有空的时候，也请给3人签好名，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "0870ade9095cb2eda0a98cec50b23ed3bc743d27dccd0f7405aacffc40b9b687", "ja": "オッケー！　海美、どっちが一番遠くのお客さんまで\n水風船投げられるか、勝負しようぜ！", "zh": "好！海美，我们来比赛，看谁能把水球扔到最远的客人那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "956b09fbe1ded593868895890908866a7eb14b5d3cc51e6894995751371f9d21", "ja": "いいよ☆　でも今日の私は絶好調だから、すっごく\n遠くまで投げられると思う！　100メートルくらい！", "zh": "好啊☆不过今天的我状态超好，应该能扔到非常远的地方！大概有100米那么远！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "4488b8e89fb3a291534322af163221b85a7c202eeba82b44ee769b6be3c7c061", "ja": "ちぇっ、マジでそれくらい投げそうだよな～。\n見てろ～、オレだって！", "zh": "啧，感觉你今天真的能投那么远啊～\n看好了～我也能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9df845e5b3df64550a849b6a60cd4a3407f1f65d87c2aa8771a6a364e145e0d2", "ja": "あはは、場外は危ないから減点だぞ？", "zh": "哈哈，扔出场外可就危险了，要扣分哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_03_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "632559452f249563adb2f3133c300d46e6b0657708dd3b5c6c2ca76ed4a59e89", "ja": "えへへっ、私はいっぱいサイン書いちゃお～っと！\n水風船のお土産～♪　テンションはあげあげ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我要写好多好多签名～！\n水气球伴手礼～♪ 情绪高涨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
